Value Required PEER (\S+)
Value PEER_AS (\d+)
Value INPKT (\d+)
Value OUTPKT (\d+)
Value OUTQ (\d+)
Value FLAPS (\d+)
Value UPTIME (\S+(?:\s+\S+)?)
Value STATE (\S+)

Start
  # Main peer line — 8 fields: peer, AS, inpkt, outpkt, outq, flaps, uptime, state.
  # UPTIME is "HH:MM:SS" for sessions <24h (single token) or "Nd Nh" for older
  # (two tokens with whitespace) — accept either via optional second segment.
  ^${PEER}\s+${PEER_AS}\s+${INPKT}\s+${OUTPKT}\s+${OUTQ}\s+${FLAPS}\s+${UPTIME}\s+${STATE}\s* -> Record
  # Ignore everything else (headers, table stats, per-table peer sub-lines)
  ^. -> Continue
